---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="选课投点计算器 | 工具" description="在浏览器本地估算北大选课意愿点分配。">
  <div class="tool-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/tools/">返回工具</a>

    <header class="tool-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Course Bidding</p>
        <h1>选课投点计算器</h1>
        <p class="intro">根据课程热度和你的偏好，在需要抽签的课程之间分配 99 个意愿点。</p>
      </div>
      <span class="local-badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 10V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2" />
          <rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2" />
          <path d="M12 14v2" />
        </svg>
        仅在本地处理
      </span>
    </header>

    <section class="calculator" aria-labelledby="courses-title">
      <div class="calculator-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Your Courses</p>
          <h2 id="courses-title">课程信息</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="course-actions">
          <button class="secondary-button" id="open-import" type="button">粘贴导入</button>
          <button class="secondary-button" id="add-course" type="button">
            <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span> 添加课程
          </button>
          <button class="clear-button" id="clear-courses" type="button">清空课程</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="field-help">快乐值表示你想选这门课的程度，可以填学分或任意正数；数值越大，工具越优先照顾这门课。</p>
      <div class="course-grid-head" id="course-grid-head" hidden aria-hidden="true">
        <span>#</span>
        <span>课程<small>选填</small></span>
        <span>限选</span>
        <span>已选</span>
        <span>快乐</span>
        <span>投点 / 中签</span>
        <span></span>
      </div>
      <div id="course-list" class="course-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div id="empty-courses" class="empty-courses" hidden>
        <strong>还没有课程</strong>
        <p>添加一门课程后即可开始计算。</p>
        <button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-add-course>添加课程</button>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button class="primary-button" id="calculate" type="button">计算推荐投点</button>
        <p id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status">课程信息会自动保存。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="summary" id="result-summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title" hidden>
      <div>
        <span>已分配意愿点</span>
        <strong id="allocated-points">0 / 99</strong>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>总期望快乐值</span>
        <strong id="expected-happiness">0.000</strong>
      </div>
      <p id="summary-title">结果是基于历史模型的估算，不代表实际中签结果。</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="method-note">
      <h2>算法说明</h2>
      <p>
        计算机制参考了<a href="https://wyjjmzx.github.io/pku/toudian.html" rel="noreferrer">原始选课投点工具</a>：
        先根据限选人数和已选人数估算竞争程度，再逐点调整分配，使总期望快乐值尽可能高。当前未超过限选人数的课程不参与投点。
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <dialog class="import-dialog" id="import-dialog" aria-labelledby="import-title">
    <div class="import-dialog__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Paste Courses</p>
        <h2 id="import-title">从选课页导入</h2>
      </div>
      <button class="dialog-close" id="close-import" type="button" aria-label="关闭导入窗口">×</button>
    </div>
    <p class="import-guide">在北大选课网站进入“预选 → 已选列表”，复制完整列表后粘贴到这里。</p>
    <p class="import-warning">导入会替换当前全部课程；勾选后，同一课程已填写的快乐值会保留。</p>
    <label class="import-option">
      <input id="preserve-happiness" type="checkbox" checked />
      <span>
        <strong>保留已有快乐值</strong>
        <small>按课程号和班号匹配，新课程仍需填写。</small>
      </span>
    </label>
    <label class="import-field">
      <span>选课列表文本</span>
      <textarea id="import-text" rows="8" placeholder="在这里粘贴复制的已选列表…"></textarea>
    </label>
    <div class="import-preview" id="import-preview" aria-live="polite">
      <p id="import-status">粘贴后会在这里预览识别结果。</p>
      <ul id="import-courses"></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="import-actions">
      <button class="secondary-button" id="cancel-import" type="button">取消</button>
      <button class="primary-button" id="confirm-import" type="button" disabled>导入课程</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <template id="course-template">
    <article class="course-row">
      <div class="course-index" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <label class="field field--name">
        <span>课程名 <em>选填</em></span>
        <input data-field="name" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如：社会心理学" />
      </label>
      <label class="field field--capacity">
        <span>限选人数</span>
        <input data-field="capacity" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" />
        <small data-error="capacity"></small>
      </label>
      <label class="field field--enrolled">
        <span>已选人数</span>
        <input data-field="enrolled" type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" />
        <small data-error="enrolled"></small>
      </label>
      <label class="field field--happiness">
        <span>快乐值</span>
        <input data-field="happiness" type="number" min="0" step="any" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="如：课程学分" />
        <small data-error="happiness"></small>
      </label>
      <div class="course-result">
        <span>推荐投点</span>
        <strong data-result="points">—</strong>
        <small data-result="probability" data-state="pending">计算后显示中签率</small>
      </div>
      <button class="delete-course" type="button" aria-label="删除课程"><span aria-hidden="true">删除</span></button>
    </article>
  </template>

  <script>
    import { recommendCoursePoints, type CourseInput } from '../../lib/course-bidding';
    import { parseCourseSelectionText, prepareImportedCourses } from '../../lib/course-import.mjs';

    type CourseDraft = {
      id: string;
      sourceKey: string | null;
      name: string;
      capacity: number | null;
      enrolled: number | null;
      happiness: number | null;
    };

    type ImportedCourse = {
      sourceKey: string;
      courseCode: string;
      classNumber: string;
      name: string;
      capacity: number;
      enrolled: number;
    };

    const STORAGE_KEY = 'zhy12138.tools.course-bidding.v1';
    const courseList = document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#course-list');
    const courseGridHead = document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#course-grid-head');
    const emptyCourses = document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#empty-courses');
    const template = document.querySelector<HTMLTemplateElement>('#course-template');
    const addButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#add-course');
    const clearButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#clear-courses');
    const calculateButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#calculate');
    const formStatus = document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>('#form-status');
    const summary = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-summary');
    const allocatedPoints = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#allocated-points');
    const expectedHappiness = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#expected-happiness');
    const importDialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('#import-dialog');
    const importText = document.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#import-text');
    const importStatus = document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>('#import-status');
    const importCourses = document.querySelector<HTMLUListElement>('#import-courses');
    const confirmImport = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#confirm-import');
    const preserveHappiness = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#preserve-happiness');

    const newId = () => globalThis.crypto?.randomUUID?.() ?? `${Date.now()}-${Math.random()}`;
    const blankCourse = (): CourseDraft => ({
      id: newId(),
      sourceKey: null,
      name: '',
      capacity: null,
      enrolled: null,
      happiness: null,
    });

    function isNullableNumber(value: unknown): value is number | null {
      return value === null || (typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value));
    }

    function isCourseDraft(value: unknown): value is CourseDraft {
      if (!value || typeof value !== 'object') return false;
      const course = value as Partial<CourseDraft>;
      return typeof course.id === 'string'
        && (course.sourceKey === undefined || course.sourceKey === null || typeof course.sourceKey === 'string')
        && typeof course.name === 'string'
        && isNullableNumber(course.capacity)
        && isNullableNumber(course.enrolled)
        && isNullableNumber(course.happiness);
    }

    function loadCourses(): CourseDraft[] {
      try {
        const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
        if (raw === null) return [blankCourse()];
        const stored = JSON.parse(raw) as { version?: unknown; courses?: unknown };
        if ((stored.version !== 1 && stored.version !== 2 && stored.version !== 3)
          || !Array.isArray(stored.courses)
          || !stored.courses.every(isCourseDraft)) {
          return [blankCourse()];
        }
        return stored.courses.map((course) => ({
          id: course.id,
          sourceKey: typeof course.sourceKey === 'string' ? course.sourceKey : null,
          name: course.name,
          capacity: course.capacity,
          enrolled: course.enrolled,
          happiness: course.happiness,
        }));
      } catch {
        return [blankCourse()];
      }
    }

    let courses = loadCourses();

    function saveCourses() {
      try {
        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify({ version: 3, courses }));
        return true;
      } catch {
        if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = '浏览器未能保存数据，本次输入仍可继续计算。';
        return false;
      }
    }

    function parseNumber(value: string) {
      if (value.trim() === '') return null;
      const number = Number(value);
      return Number.isFinite(number) ? number : null;
    }

    function markResultsStale() {
      summary?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      courseList?.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-result="points"]').forEach((node) => node.textContent = '—');
      courseList?.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-result="probability"]').forEach((node) => {
        node.textContent = '计算后显示中签率';
        node.dataset.state = 'pending';
        delete node.dataset.compact;
      });
      if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = '更改已保存，点击计算更新结果。';
    }

    let parsedImport: { courses: ImportedCourse[]; skipped: number } = { courses: [], skipped: 0 };

    function renderImportPreview() {
      if (!importStatus || !importCourses || !confirmImport) return;
      importCourses.replaceChildren();
      confirmImport.disabled = parsedImport.courses.length === 0;
      confirmImport.textContent = '导入课程';

      if (!importText?.value.trim()) {
        importStatus.textContent = '粘贴后会在这里预览识别结果。';
        return;
      }
      if (!parsedImport.courses.length) {
        importStatus.textContent = '没有识别到课程，请确认复制的是“预选 → 已选列表”的完整内容。';
        return;
      }

      importStatus.textContent = `识别到 ${parsedImport.courses.length} 门课程${parsedImport.skipped ? `，另有 ${parsedImport.skipped} 个条目未识别` : ''}。`;
      confirmImport.textContent = `覆盖并导入 ${parsedImport.courses.length} 门`;
      parsedImport.courses.forEach((course) => {
        const item = document.createElement('li');
        const name = document.createElement('strong');
        const counts = document.createElement('span');
        name.textContent = course.name;
        counts.textContent = `限选 ${course.capacity} · 已选 ${course.enrolled}`;
        item.append(name, counts);
        importCourses.append(item);
      });
    }

    function openImportDialog() {
      if (!importDialog || !importText) return;
      importText.value = '';
      parsedImport = { courses: [], skipped: 0 };
      renderImportPreview();
      importDialog.showModal();
      importText.focus();
    }

    function closeImportDialog() {
      importDialog?.close();
    }

    function importParsedCourses() {
      if (!parsedImport.courses.length) return;
      const shouldPreserveHappiness = preserveHappiness?.checked ?? true;
      const preparedCourses = prepareImportedCourses(
        parsedImport.courses,
        courses,
        shouldPreserveHappiness,
      ) as Array<ImportedCourse & { happiness: number | null }>;
      const preservedCount = preparedCourses.filter((course) => course.happiness !== null).length;
      courses = preparedCourses.map((course) => ({
        id: newId(),
        sourceKey: course.sourceKey,
        name: course.name,
        capacity: course.capacity,
        enrolled: course.enrolled,
        happiness: course.happiness,
      }));
      const saved = saveCourses();
      renderCourses();
      markResultsStale();
      if (formStatus && saved) {
        formStatus.textContent = shouldPreserveHappiness && preservedCount > 0
          ? `已覆盖并导入 ${parsedImport.courses.length} 门课程，保留了 ${preservedCount} 门课程的快乐值。`
          : `已覆盖并导入 ${parsedImport.courses.length} 门课程，请填写快乐值。`;
      }
      closeImportDialog();
    }

    function addCourse() {
      courses.push(blankCourse());
      saveCourses();
      renderCourses();
      courseList?.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('.course-row:last-child [data-field="name"]')?.focus();
    }

    function clearCourses() {
      if (!courses.length || !window.confirm('确定清空所有课程吗？此操作会同步清除本地保存的课程。')) return;
      courses = [];
      saveCourses();
      renderCourses();
      summary?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = '课程已清空。';
    }

    function renderCourses() {
      if (!courseList || !template || !emptyCourses) return;
      courseList.replaceChildren();
      emptyCourses.hidden = courses.length > 0;
      if (courseGridHead) courseGridHead.hidden = courses.length === 0;
      calculateButton?.toggleAttribute('disabled', courses.length === 0);
      clearButton?.toggleAttribute('disabled', courses.length === 0);

      courses.forEach((course, index) => {
        const fragment = template.content.cloneNode(true) as DocumentFragment;
        const row = fragment.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.course-row');
        const indexNode = fragment.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.course-index');
        if (!row || !indexNode) return;
        row.dataset.courseId = course.id;
        indexNode.textContent = String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0');

        const bindField = (field: keyof Pick<CourseDraft, 'name' | 'capacity' | 'enrolled' | 'happiness'>) => {
          const input = fragment.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[data-field="${field}"]`);
          if (!input) return;
          input.value = course[field] === null ? '' : String(course[field]);
          input.addEventListener('input', () => {
            if (field === 'name') course.name = input.value;
            else course[field] = parseNumber(input.value);
            input.closest('.field')?.classList.remove('field--invalid');
            const error = input.closest('.field')?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-error]');
            if (error) error.textContent = '';
            saveCourses();
            markResultsStale();
          });
        };
        bindField('name');
        bindField('capacity');
        bindField('enrolled');
        bindField('happiness');

        const deleteButton = fragment.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.delete-course');
        deleteButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
          courses = courses.filter((item) => item.id !== course.id);
          saveCourses();
          renderCourses();
          if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = `${course.name.trim() || `课程 ${index + 1}`}已删除。`;
        });
        courseList.append(fragment);
      });
    }

    function showError(row: HTMLElement, field: 'capacity' | 'enrolled' | 'happiness', message: string) {
      const input = row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[data-field="${field}"]`);
      const wrapper = input?.closest('.field');
      const error = wrapper?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-error]');
      wrapper?.classList.add('field--invalid');
      if (error) error.textContent = message;
      return input;
    }

    function calculate() {
      if (!courseList || !courses.length) return;
      let firstInvalid: HTMLInputElement | null | undefined;
      const validCourses: CourseInput[] = [];

      courses.forEach((course) => {
        const row = courseList.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-course-id="${CSS.escape(course.id)}"]`);
        if (!row) return;
        row.querySelectorAll('.field--invalid').forEach((field) => field.classList.remove('field--invalid'));
        row.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-error]').forEach((error) => error.textContent = '');

        if (!Number.isInteger(course.capacity) || (course.capacity ?? 0) <= 0) {
          firstInvalid ??= showError(row, 'capacity', '请输入大于 0 的整数');
        }
        if (!Number.isInteger(course.enrolled) || (course.enrolled ?? -1) < 0) {
          firstInvalid ??= showError(row, 'enrolled', '请输入非负整数');
        }
        if (course.happiness === null || course.happiness <= 0) {
          firstInvalid ??= showError(row, 'happiness', '请输入正数');
        }

        if (Number.isInteger(course.capacity) && course.capacity! > 0
          && Number.isInteger(course.enrolled) && course.enrolled! >= 0
          && course.happiness !== null && course.happiness > 0) {
          validCourses.push(course as CourseInput);
        }
      });

      if (firstInvalid || validCourses.length !== courses.length) {
        if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = '请先修正标出的课程信息。';
        summary?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        firstInvalid?.focus();
        return;
      }

      const recommendations = recommendCoursePoints(validCourses);
      recommendations.forEach((course, index) => {
        const row = courseList.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-course-id="${CSS.escape(course.id)}"]`);
        const points = row?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-result="points"]');
        const probability = row?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-result="probability"]');
        if (points) points.textContent = String(course.points);
        if (probability) {
          probability.textContent = course.needsLottery
            ? `${course.probability.toFixed(2)}%`
            : '无需抽签';
          probability.dataset.state = course.needsLottery ? 'lottery' : 'safe';
          probability.dataset.compact = course.needsLottery ? `${Math.round(course.probability)}%` : '无需';
        }
        row?.style.setProperty('--result-order', String(index));
      });

      const lotteryCourses = recommendations.filter((course) => course.needsLottery);
      const totalPoints = lotteryCourses.reduce((total, course) => total + course.points, 0);
      const totalHappiness = recommendations.reduce((total, course) => total + course.expectedHappiness, 0);
      if (allocatedPoints) allocatedPoints.textContent = `${totalPoints} / 99`;
      if (expectedHappiness) expectedHappiness.textContent = totalHappiness.toFixed(3);
      summary?.removeAttribute('hidden');
      if (formStatus) {
        formStatus.textContent = lotteryCourses.length
          ? '计算完成。推荐点数合计为 99。'
          : '这些课程当前都未超额，无需分配意愿点。';
      }
    }

    addButton?.addEventListener('click', addCourse);
    clearButton?.addEventListener('click', clearCourses);
    document.querySelector('[data-add-course]')?.addEventListener('click', addCourse);
    calculateButton?.addEventListener('click', calculate);
    document.querySelector('#open-import')?.addEventListener('click', openImportDialog);
    document.querySelector('#close-import')?.addEventListener('click', closeImportDialog);
    document.querySelector('#cancel-import')?.addEventListener('click', closeImportDialog);
    confirmImport?.addEventListener('click', importParsedCourses);
    importText?.addEventListener('input', () => {
      parsedImport = parseCourseSelectionText(importText.value) as { courses: ImportedCourse[]; skipped: number };
      renderImportPreview();
    });
    importDialog?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      if (event.target === importDialog) closeImportDialog();
    });
    renderCourses();
  </script>

  <style>
    .tool-page { padding: 18px 0 24px; }
    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 720;
    }
    .back-link:hover,
    .back-link:focus-visible {
      color: var(--primary-strong);
      outline: none;
    }

    .tool-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 32px;
      padding: 34px 0 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 9px; color: var(--accent); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); line-height: 1.02; }
    .intro { max-width: 720px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; }

    .local-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      padding: 10px 13px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 167, 181, .24);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .76);
      color: #08727a;
      font-size: .88rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }
    .local-badge svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }

    .calculator {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220, 232, 245, .96);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(42, 88, 138, .09);
    }
    .calculator-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; }
    .calculator-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.55rem; }
    .course-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; }
    .field-help { margin: 14px 0 22px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .course-grid-head { display: none; }
    .course-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }

    .course-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 36px minmax(150px, 1.5fr) repeat(3, minmax(100px, .75fr)) minmax(130px, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: rgba(248, 251, 255, .76);
    }
    .course-index { padding-top: 30px; color: rgba(20, 103, 216, .7); font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 750; }
    .field { display: grid; gap: 7px; min-width: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .field em { margin-left: 3px; color: var(--accent); font-size: .68rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 800; }
    .field input {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      height: 42px;
      padding: 0 11px;
      border: 1px solid #cfdeed;
      border-radius: 7px;
      outline: none;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
      font: inherit;
      font-size: .94rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .field input[type="number"] { appearance: textfield; -moz-appearance: textfield; }
